{"seq":1,"slug":"semantic-html-aria","title":"语义化 HTML 与 ARIA：构建正确的语义层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/implementation/semantic-html-aria","wordCount":951,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"语义化-html-与-aria-构建正确的语义层\">语义化 HTML 与 ARIA：构建正确的语义层</h1><p>语义化是无障碍工程的基石。辅助技术依赖语义信息来理解界面，向用户传达内容的结构、角色和状态。本文覆盖原生 HTML 语义的正确使用和 ARIA 的合理增强策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语义化是指选用能准确表达内容含义的 HTML 元素，而非仅考虑视觉呈现。ARIA（Accessible Rich Internet Applications）是 W3C 规范，通过 <code>role</code>、<code>aria-*</code> 属性为浏览器可访问性树添加或修正语义信息。<strong>ARIA 的第一原则：如有原生语义 HTML，优先使用原生元素</strong>——原生元素的语义是免费的，不需要额外 ARIA，也不容易出错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"html-原生语义的优先原则\">HTML 原生语义的优先原则</h2><p>原生 HTML 元素自带隐式语义，浏览器将其映射到可访问性树：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 原生语义：按钮，可键盘聚焦，有隐式 role=&quot;button&quot; --&gt;&#10;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot;&gt;提交&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 错误做法：div 模拟按钮，需要大量 ARIA 补全 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div role=&quot;button&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; aria-pressed=&quot;false&quot; onkeydown=&quot;handleKey(event)&quot; onclick=&quot;handleClick()&quot;&gt;提交&lt;/div&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 原生语义：按钮，可键盘聚焦，有隐式 role=\"button\" --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>提交&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 错误做法：div 模拟按钮，需要大量 ARIA 补全 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tabindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-pressed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onkeydown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleKey</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">event</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onclick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleClick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">()\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>提交&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>原生 <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> 自带：键盘聚焦（Tab）、空格/回车激活、正确的角色映射、在表单内的提交行为。<code>div</code> 模拟需要手动补全所有这些行为，且容易遗漏边界情况（如在 <code>&lt;form&gt;</code> 内的行为、触摸设备的激活等）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"html-语义元素速查\">HTML 语义元素速查</h2><h3 id=\"文档结构与地标\">文档结构与地标</h3><p>地标元素让屏幕阅读器用户可以快速跳转到页面主要区域（NVDA 按 D 跳地标）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素</th>\n<th>ARIA 角色</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&lt;main&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>main</code></td>\n<td>页面主要内容，每页一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;nav&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>navigation</code></td>\n<td>导航链接组，用 <code>aria-label</code> 区分多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;header&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>banner</code>（顶层）</td>\n<td>页眉，在 <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> 内是 <code>generic</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;footer&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>contentinfo</code>（顶层）</td>\n<td>页脚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;aside&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>complementary</code></td>\n<td>侧栏/补充内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;section&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>region</code>（有名称时）</td>\n<td>有标题的内容区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;search&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>search</code></td>\n<td>搜索表单（HTML 5.2+）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>多导航的正确处理</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 用 aria-label 区分同一页面的多个导航 --&gt;&#10;&lt;nav aria-label=&quot;主导航&quot;&gt;...&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;nav aria-label=&quot;面包屑导航&quot;&gt;...&lt;/nav&gt;&#10;&lt;nav aria-label=&quot;页脚快捷链接&quot;&gt;...&lt;/nav&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 用 aria-label 区分同一页面的多个导航 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"主导航\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"面包屑导航\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"页脚快捷链接\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"标题层级\">标题层级</h3><p>标题是屏幕阅读器用户最重要的导航机制（H 键跳标题）。标题层级必须逻辑连续：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 正确：层级连续 --&gt;&#10;&lt;h1&gt;产品文档&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;h2&gt;快速开始&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;安装&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3&gt;配置&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h2&gt;API 参考&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 错误：跳级，h2 后直接 h4 --&gt;&#10;&lt;h2&gt;章节标题&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h4&gt;子章节&lt;/h4&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 正确：层级连续 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>产品文档&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>快速开始&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>安装&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>配置&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>API 参考&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 错误：跳级，h2 后直接 h4 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>章节标题&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>子章节&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>每页只有一个 <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>，代表页面主题。标题用于文档结构，不要因为样式大小选择标题级别——样式用 CSS 控制，结构用标题级别控制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"表单语义\">表单语义</h3><p>表单无障碍的核心是<strong>每个控件都有关联标签</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 方法一：for/id 显式关联（推荐）--&gt;&#10;&lt;label for=&quot;email&quot;&gt;电子邮件&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&lt;input id=&quot;email&quot; type=&quot;email&quot; required /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 方法二：包裹关联（简洁）--&gt;&#10;&lt;label&gt;&#10;  电子邮件&#10;  &lt;input type=&quot;email&quot; required /&gt;&#10;&lt;/label&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 方法三：aria-labelledby（复杂场景）--&gt;&#10;&lt;div id=&quot;email-label&quot;&gt;电子邮件&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;input aria-labelledby=&quot;email-label&quot; type=&quot;email&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 错误：placeholder 不是标签 --&gt;&#10;&lt;input type=&quot;email&quot; placeholder=&quot;请输入电子邮件&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 方法一：for/id 显式关联（推荐）--></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>电子邮件&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 方法二：包裹关联（简洁）--></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  电子邮件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 方法三：aria-labelledby（复杂场景）--></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email-label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>电子邮件&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-labelledby</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email-label\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 错误：placeholder 不是标签 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> placeholder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请输入电子邮件\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><p>表单必填字段标记：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- HTML 原生 required：AT 会读&quot;必填&quot;--&gt;&#10;&lt;input type=&quot;email&quot; required aria-describedby=&quot;email-help&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;p id=&quot;email-help&quot;&gt;我们只用于发送验证邮件&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 视觉星号需配文字说明 --&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;带 &lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; 的字段为必填项&lt;/p&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- HTML 原生 required：AT 会读\"必填\"--></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> required</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-describedby</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email-help\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email-help\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>我们只用于发送验证邮件&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span>