"> role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tabindex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onclick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">doAction</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">()\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onkeydown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Enter'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' ')</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">doAction</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">()\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>操作&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>反模式 3：装饰性图片加有意义 alt</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 错误：装饰图片加描述性 alt，SR 会朗读 --&gt;&#10;&lt;img src=&quot;decoration.png&quot; alt=&quot;装饰图案&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 正确：空 alt 让 SR 跳过 --&gt;&#10;&lt;img src=&quot;decoration.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 错误：装饰图片加描述性 alt，SR 会朗读 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">img</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"decoration.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> alt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"装饰图案\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 正确：空 alt 让 SR 跳过 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">img</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"decoration.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> alt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与相关章节的关系\">与相关章节的关系</h2><p><a href=\"keyboard-focus-management\">键盘与焦点管理</a>将深入讨论 ARIA 角色对键盘行为的要求；<a href=\"../foundations/accessibility-tree\">可访问性树</a>解释了本文中 ARIA 属性如何映射到可访问性树节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>语义化 HTML 是无障碍的基础：优先使用原生元素，只在必要时用 ARIA 补充。关键实践是为所有表单控件提供程序关联的标签（非 placeholder），保持标题层级连续，用地标元素划定页面区域。ARIA 使用时遵循五原则，尤其是&quot;有原生语义优先用原生&quot;和&quot;可交互控件必须支持键盘操作&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语义化 HTML 与 ARIA：构建正确的语义层","id":"语义化-html-与-aria-构建正确的语义层"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"HTML 原生语义的优先原则","id":"html-原生语义的优先原则"},{"level":2,"text":"HTML 语义元素速查","id":"html-语义元素速查"},{"level":3,"text":"文档结构与地标","id":"文档结构与地标"},{"level":3,"text":"标题层级","id":"标题层级"},{"level":3,"text":"表单语义","id":"表单语义"},{"level":2,"text":"ARIA 的正确使用场景","id":"aria-的正确使用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"ARIA 角色（Roles）","id":"aria-角色-roles"},{"level":3,"text":"ARIA 状态与属性","id":"aria-状态与属性"},{"level":2,"text":"地标与标题的综合示例","id":"地标与标题的综合示例"},{"level":2,"text":"常见反模式","id":"常见反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"与相关章节的关系","id":"与相关章节的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可访问性树：浏览器的无障碍数据结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/foundations/accessibility-tree"},"next":{"title":"键盘与焦点管理：让界面对键盘完全可操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-engineering/implementation/keyboard-focus-management"}}